Package: streamplayer
Version: 0.1.0-m5stack17
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Zhu Zhe <1917345+zhuzhe1983@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: APPLaunch
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/zhuzhe1983/cp0-StreamPlayer
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libinput10, libxkbcommon0, libudev1, ca-certificates, curl, alsa-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, ffmpeg, mpv, fonts-noto-cjk
Recommends: pipewire-bin, wireplumber, bluez
Description: Emby and Jellyfin media player for CardputerZero
 StreamPlayer browses Emby and Jellyfin libraries and plays media through
 CardputerZero's LCD, speaker, headphone, or Bluetooth outputs.
 Store edition: no privileged services, system tuning, or HDMI output.
